ent measures, type of product, throughout the life-cycle - should lead to a weight-of evidence argumentation that exposure is absent or not significant.", "metadata": {"doc_id": "e0d2e9c3-bf28-4cc4-9cf6-8328046fc209", "content_type": "CompositeElement", "filename": "information_requirements_r5_en.pdf"}}